ail-typo-squatting
https://github.com/typosquatter/ail-typo-squatting

Algorithms ported to TypeScript from version 2.7.6 (commit
48d1103f6b4d4df4598db6f9b37144046711102a), with modifications listed in each
file header. No data files were copied:

  src/core/permute/techniques/replacement.ts     (generator/replacement.py)
  src/core/permute/techniques/numeral-swap.ts    (generator/numeralSwap.py;
                                                 numeral groups written for Markwatch)
  src/core/permute/techniques/hyphenation.ts     (hyphen removal, generator/stripDash.py)

Not used: etc/common-misspellings.json and etc/homophones.txt, which are
derived from Wikipedia (CC BY-SA) and not covered by the BSD license below,
and the ail homoglyph table (Markwatch takes its table from dnstwist).

