Bundled third-party software

The built app (dist/index.html) is a single minified file. It bundles the
npm packages react, react-dom, scheduler, zod, fflate, punycode, tldts and
tldts-core (all MIT-licensed), and CSS generated by tailwindcss (MIT).
Their license texts, together with this NOTICE, the Apache License 2.0 and
the ail-typo-squatting license above, are reproduced in full in
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md and embedded in the built file itself, where they
are shown on the "About & privacy" page under "Licenses". Both are generated
by scripts/third-party-notices.mjs (npm run notices, run by npm run build).

